:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the enemy, see [[Easter Egg Cat (Enemy)]].''
'''Eggy Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that was implemented in [[Version 5.10 Update|Version 5.10]] and can be unlocked when beating any stage in [[Cats Abloom!#Spring Sprang Sprung|Spring Sprang Sprung]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 12.2 Update|Version 12.2]] increases Slow chance to 100%.

