==Trivia==
*Easter Cat's ability to spew energy rings from the Moai inside his body is a reference to how the [[wikia:gradius:Moai|Moai]] enemies from the ''[[wikipedia:Gradius|Gradius]]'' series attack.
**The three golden Moai inside Easter Egg Cat closely resemble the [[wikia:gradius:Totem Moai|Totem Moai]] from ''[[wikipedia:Gradius III|Gradius III]]'', even down to how only the forward-facing head attacks.
*The text 「トッオク  イゴア  コ  ネコエッグ３」 from the Japanese True Form description is a sentence in the [[wikipedia:Rapa Nui language|Rapa Nui language]] represented in katakana. It translates to "My name is Cat Egg 3".
*The text "Toku igoa ko Eggy Cat!" is a romanization of another sentence in the Rapa Nui language translating to "My name is Eggy Cat!" in English.

